Modifications (2026-11-11, fork v7):
- src/lib.rs: API_URL api-get-v2.mgsearcher.com -> api-get-v3.mgsearcher.com
  (the v2 host 301s chapter calls to v3 and 302s the new chapter path to a
  dead host).
- src/lib.rs: get_page_list now calls /api/v2/chapter/getinfo (the old
  /api/chapter/getinfo returns 410 "Legacy chapter API is disabled") and
  decodes the obfuscated images string; the image host follows the
  reader's line mapping (line 2 -> c-nd2-1.6wm.top, otherwise
  c-nd3-1.6wm.top). The old f40-1-4.g-mh.online host is gone.
- src/decode.rs (new): re-implementation of the reader's chapter image
  decoder (marker split, segment re-order, odd 7-char chunk reversal,
  custom-alphabet to base64url substitution, base64url decode to JSON).
  No site JavaScript is included in this source and no key material is
  involved; see NOTES for the full reverse-engineering evidence.
- src/lib.rs: get_manga_details description now comes from the chapter
  API's data.desc, falling back to <meta name="description"> with the
  leading first-chapter-title prefix stripped; the old
  .text-medium.my-unit-md selector no longer exists on the site. Title
  suffix cleanup now also strips "-包子漫畫" (the "-🌈️包子漫畫" suffix
  is gone from page titles).
- res/source.json: version 6 -> 7.
- Cargo.toml: package renamed aidoku-baozimh2 -> baozimh2 so the built
  wasm is baozimh2.wasm (same convention as the registry's other
  sources); aidoku pinned to the 0.2.0 rev the v6 .aix was built against
  (bae338b1), because current aidoku-rs main (0.3.0) removed the
  #[get_manga_list] macro API this source uses; base64 0.22 added for
  the chapter image decoder.
- res/settings.json: new empty array. Upstream ships no settings file;
  the empty file exists only so package.py validates the same res/ set
  as the registry's other sources. It exposes no settings.
No other upstream file was changed.
